  <section class="opt">
    <p class="opt-label">C. Interval mark</p>
    <h1>Pranav Kasetty<svg class="sig-mark" viewBox="0 0 40 14" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="3" x2="37" y1="7" y2="7"/><circle cx="27" cy="7" r="4.5"/></svg></h1>
    <p class="roles">Independent AI safety research<br>Software Engineer, Capital One, Bengaluru</p>
    <h2><svg class="sig-mark" viewBox="0 0 40 14" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="3" x2="37" y1="7" y2="7"/><circle cx="27" cy="7" r="4.5"/></svg>Research</h2>
    <p class="opt-note">The favicon's dot-on-an-interval, used as a small mark after the name and before section headings. The quietest option: measurement with uncertainty as the site's identity.</p>
  </section>
</main></body></html>
